      "message": "test(wire): set taper_deg in the wire_stamp WireContourOp literal\n\n#1163 added the taper_deg field to WireContourOp; wire_stamp.rs still\nbuilt its literal without it, so the camcraft-app test binary did not\ncompile on main. Test-only: taper_deg 0.0 (no taper), as the other\nwire test literals set it. Every camcraft-app test binary compiles.\n\nFixes #1377\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
